<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#5f4788; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table border="0" cellpadding="0" width="650" cellspacing="0" height="400"><tbody><tr valign="top"><td width="460" style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); font-size: 12pt;"><table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="460" cellspacing="5" height="400"><tbody><tr valign="top" height="400"><td teditid="c1r1" aeditid="c1r1" locked="0" id="c1r1" style="font-size: 12pt; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 255); border-style: dashed;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;">Dear Patron,</span><br style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;"><br style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;">We would like to take this opportunity to welcome you to the array of our esteemed customers and feel deeply humbled for the trust you have placed in our organization.</span><br style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;"><br style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;">At Monsterindia.com, we pride ourselves in offering responsive, competent and scalable recruitment solutions to help you find better and leverage your company’s core asset -&nbsp;</span><em style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;">YOUR PEOPLE.&nbsp;</em><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;">We foster this commitment through our excellent services and support, coordinated by a steering team dedicated to your account.&nbsp;</span><br style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;"><br style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;">For business related queries or suggestions, please get in touch with us through our helpline numbers given in the right panel.</span><br style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;"><br style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;">Thank you for choosing us. Looking forward to a great business association with you.&nbsp;</span><br style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;"><br style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;">Sincerely,</span><br style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;">Team Monster</span></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td width="10" style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); font-size: 12pt;"></td><td width="180" style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); font-size: 12pt;"><table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="180" cellspacing="5" height="400"><tbody><tr valign="top" height="100"><td rowspan="3" width="180" teditid="c2r1" aeditid="c2r1" locked="